  {
   "id": "RES#871:829a",
   "off": 33434,
   "len": 136,
   "bank": "0.1",
   "jp": "{1c:11}でも1人では危険じゃないか?\nそうだ、僕も一緒に行くよ。{1a}外の事も心配だけど、\n今僕達のすべきことは\n{0b:05}{14}を助ける事なんだ。{1a}{10}、力を合わせて\n『シェオルの{e082}』を壊し、\n{0b:05}{14}の魂を救い出そう!{0c:fe}",
   "read": "{1c:11}でも1人では危険じゃないか?\nそうだ、僕も一緒に行くよ。{1a}外の事も心配だけど、\n今僕達のすべきことは\n{0b:05}{14}を助ける事なんだ。{1a}{10}、力を合わせて\n『シェオルの柱』を壊し、\n{0b:05}{14}の魂を救い出そう!{0c:fe}",
   "raw": null,
   "en": "{1c:11}But isn't that dangerous alone? I know, I\nwill go with you.{1a}I'm worried about outside as well, but\nwhat we must do now is save\n{0b:05}{14}.{1a}{10}, let's join forces, destroy\nthe 'Pillar of Sheol' and rescue\n{0b:05}{14}'s soul!{0c:fe}",
   "status": "done",
   "tl": "But isn't that dangerous alone? I know, I will go with you. // I'm worried about outside as well, but what we must do now is save [1][VAR14]. // [HERO], let's join forces, destroy the 'Pillar of Sheol' and rescue [2][VAR14]'s soul!"
  },
