  {
   "id": "RES#871:8407",
   "off": 33799,
   "len": 180,
   "bank": "0.1",
   "jp": "{1c:12}{e084}獄の最深{e085}には\n強力な魔物がいると聞きます。\n1人だと危険ではないでしょうか?\n私もお供します。{1a}今私達のすべきことは\n{0b:05}{14}の魂を解放すること・・・{1a}外の情報も気になりますが、\n今は『シェオルの{e082}』の\n発見及び{e087}壊に心を砕きましょう。{1a}{10}、頑張りましょう。{0c:fe}",
   "read": "{1c:12}煉獄の最深部には\n強力な魔物がいると聞きます。\n1人だと危険ではないでしょうか?\n私もお供します。{1a}今私達のすべきことは\n{0b:05}{14}の魂を解放すること・・・{1a}外の情報も気になりますが、\n今は『シェオルの柱』の\n発見及び破壊に心を砕きましょう。{1a}{10}、頑張りましょう。{0c:fe}",
   "raw": null,
   "en": "{1c:12}I hear powerful monsters dwell in the\ndepths of Purgatory. Would it not be\ndangerous alone? I will accompany you.{1a}What we must do now is free\n{0b:05}{14}'s soul...{1a}The news from outside concerns me as\nwell, but for now, let us devote\nourselves to finding and destroying the\n'Pillar of Sheol'.{1a}{10}, let us do our best.{0c:fe}",
   "status": "done",
   "tl": "I hear powerful monsters dwell in the depths of Purgatory. Would it not be dangerous alone? I will accompany you. // What we must do now is free [1][VAR14]'s soul... // The news from outside concerns me as well, but for now, let us devote ourselves to finding and destroying the 'Pillar of Sheol'. // [HERO], let us do our best."
  },
